+        for bit in 0..9 {let v=(0..64).fold(0u64,|v,l|v|((((batch*64+l)>>bit)&1) as u64)<<l);if bit<5 {a.qubits[bit]=v;}else{a.bits[bit-5]=v;}}
+        for bit in 4..64{a.bits[bit]=0xa5a5a5a5a5a5a5a5;}
